  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hailing from the infamous Hideout Smashys Shop district, Cyrocluck witnessed firsthand the brutal raids of the Talonborn Clan. He survived by scavenging scraps and mastering the art of cryo-augmentation, a skill he now uses to freeze his enemies solid.",
    "class": "Cryo-Augmented Raider",
    "name": "Cyrocluck 'The Iceman' Smashy",
    "personality": "Grimly pragmatic and fiercely independent, Cyrocluck is not one for idle chatter. He trusts few, but those he deems worthy of his loyalty find him an unwavering ally. Beneath his icy exterior lies a flicker of hope for a Subchain City free from the tyranny of the DRIP barons.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Cyrocluck unleashes a blast of concentrated cryo-energy, encasing a single target in a block of ice for 2 turns. While frozen, the target is unable to act and takes 50% increased damage from all sources.",
